{"version":1,"entries":[{"lang":"vbnet","category":"基本","term":"Module と Sub Main","summary":"プログラムの開始地点。コンソールアプリでは Sub Main から始まります。","examples":[{"code":"Module Program\n  Sub Main()\n    Console.WriteLine(\"Hello\")\n  End Sub\nEnd Module","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0001"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"基本","term":"Imports","summary":"名前空間を取り込み、短い名前で使えるようにします。","examples":[{"code":"Imports System.IO","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0002"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"基本","term":"Option Strict On","summary":"暗黙の型変換などを禁止して厳密にします。バグ予防のため常に On がおすすめです。","examples":[{"code":"Option Strict On","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0003"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"基本","term":"Option Explicit","summary":"変数の宣言を必須にします。既定で On。","examples":[{"code":"Option Explicit On","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0004"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"基本","term":"Option Infer","summary":"初期値から型を推論するかを決めます。","examples":[{"code":"Option Infer On","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0005"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"基本","term":"コメント '","summary":"シングルクォート以降は実行されません。","examples":[{"code":"' メモ","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0006"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"基本","term":"行継続","summary":"VB.NET では多くの場所で _ なしで改行を続けられます。","examples":[{"code":"Dim s = \"a\" &\n        \"b\"","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0007"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"基本","term":"Console.WriteLine / ReadLine","summary":"コンソールへの出力／入力。","examples":[{"code":"Dim s = Console.ReadLine()","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0008"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"基本","term":"MessageBox.Show","summary":"Windows フォームでメッセージを表示。","examples":[{"code":"MessageBox.Show(\"完了\")","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0009"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"基本","term":".NET Framework / .NET","summary":"VB.NET が動く実行基盤。新しいプロジェクトは .NET（旧 .NET Core）を使うのが基本です。","examples":[],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0010"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"基本","term":"Visual Studio","summary":"VB.NET の統合開発環境（IDE）。","examples":[],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0011"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"基本","term":"Windows Forms","summary":"Windows のデスクトップアプリを作る UI 技術。VB.NET が最も得意とする分野。","examples":[],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0012"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"基本","term":"プロジェクトとソリューション","summary":"プロジェクトは1つのアプリ、ソリューションはその集まり。","examples":[],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0013"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"データ型","term":"Integer / Long","summary":"32ビット／64ビット整数。","examples":[{"code":"Dim n As Integer = 10","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0014"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"データ型","term":"Double / Decimal","summary":"小数型。お金の計算は誤差の少ない Decimal。","examples":[{"code":"Dim p As Decimal = 100.5D","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0015"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"データ型","term":"String","summary":"文字列型。変更不可（不変）です。","examples":[{"code":"Dim s As String = \"abc\"","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0016"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"データ型","term":"Boolean","summary":"True / False。","examples":[{"code":"Dim ok As Boolean = True","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0017"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"データ型","term":"Char","summary":"1文字。","examples":[{"code":"Dim c As Char = \"A\"c","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0018"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"データ型","term":"Date / DateTime","summary":"日付と時刻。","examples":[{"code":"Dim d As Date = Date.Today","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0019"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"データ型","term":"Object","summary":"すべての型の元。","examples":[{"code":"Dim o As Object = 1","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0020"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"データ型","term":"Nothing","summary":"参照がない状態（Null）。","examples":[{"code":"If obj Is Nothing Then","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0021"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"データ型","term":"Nullable（?）","summary":"値型が Nothing を持てるようにする。","examples":[{"code":"Dim n As Integer? = Nothing","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0022"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"データ型","term":"配列","summary":"上限の番号で宣言する点に注意（Dim a(2) は3要素）。","examples":[{"code":"Dim a(2) As Integer","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0023"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"データ型","term":"Structure","summary":"値型の複合データ。","examples":[{"code":"Structure P\n  Public X As Integer\nEnd Structure","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0024"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"データ型","term":"Enum","summary":"名前付き定数。","examples":[{"code":"Enum Color\n  Red\n  Blue\nEnd Enum","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0025"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"データ型","term":"型変換 CInt / CStr など","summary":"明示的な型変換。","examples":[{"code":"CInt(\"12\")","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0026"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"データ型","term":"Integer.TryParse","summary":"変換できるか確認しながら変換する安全な方法。","examples":[{"code":"Dim n As Integer\nIf Integer.TryParse(s, n) Then","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0027"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"データ型","term":"Const / ReadOnly","summary":"定数／読み取り専用。","examples":[{"code":"Const MAX As Integer = 100","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0028"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"演算子","term":"& （連結）","summary":"文字列をつなぐ。+ より安全。","examples":[{"code":"\"a\" & \"b\"","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0029"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"演算子","term":"\\\\ と Mod","summary":"整数除算／あまり。","examples":[{"code":"7 \\ 2 ' 3","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0030"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"演算子","term":"^","summary":"べき乗。","examples":[{"code":"2 ^ 3 ' 8.0","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0031"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"演算子","term":"AndAlso / OrElse","summary":"短絡評価の論理演算。右側が不要なら評価しません。","examples":[{"code":"If obj IsNot Nothing AndAlso obj.Ok Then","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0032"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"演算子","term":"Is / IsNot","summary":"参照の比較。","examples":[{"code":"If a Is b Then","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0033"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"演算子","term":"Like","summary":"ワイルドカードによる文字列比較。","examples":[{"code":"\"abc\" Like \"a*\"","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0034"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"演算子","term":"If 演算子","summary":"条件に応じた値を返す式。","examples":[{"code":"Dim r = If(x > 0, \"正\", \"負\")","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0035"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"演算子","term":"If（Nothing 合体）","summary":"Nothing のとき代わりの値を使う。","examples":[{"code":"Dim s = If(name, \"既定\")","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0036"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"演算子","term":"補間文字列 $","summary":"文字列の中に { } で式を埋め込みます。","examples":[{"code":"$\"こんにちは{name}さん\"","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0037"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"制御構文","term":"If...Then...ElseIf","summary":"条件分岐。","examples":[{"code":"If n > 0 Then\n  ...\nElseIf n < 0 Then\n  ...\nEnd If","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0038"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"制御構文","term":"Select Case","summary":"値で分岐。範囲や比較も書けます。","examples":[{"code":"Select Case n\n  Case 1 To 3\n  Case Is > 10\n  Case Else\nEnd Select","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0039"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"制御構文","term":"For...Next","summary":"回数を決めた繰り返し。Step で増分を指定。","examples":[{"code":"For i = 1 To 10 Step 2\nNext","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0040"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"制御構文","term":"For Each","summary":"コレクションの各要素を処理。","examples":[{"code":"For Each s In list\nNext","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0041"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"制御構文","term":"While / Do...Loop","summary":"条件で繰り返し。","examples":[{"code":"Do While n > 0\n  n -= 1\nLoop","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0042"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"制御構文","term":"Exit / Continue","summary":"Exit For, Exit Do で抜け、Continue For で次へ。","examples":[{"code":"Continue For","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0043"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"制御構文","term":"Try...Catch...Finally","summary":"例外処理。","examples":[{"code":"Try\n  ...\nCatch ex As Exception\n  MessageBox.Show(ex.Message)\nFinally\n  ...\nEnd Try","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0044"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"制御構文","term":"Throw","summary":"例外を発生させます。","examples":[{"code":"Throw New ArgumentException(\"不正\")","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0045"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"制御構文","term":"Using","summary":"使い終わったら自動で解放（Dispose）します。","examples":[{"code":"Using sr As New StreamReader(\"a.txt\")\n  s = sr.ReadToEnd()\nEnd Using","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0046"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"制御構文","term":"With...End With","summary":"同じオブジェクトへの操作をまとめる。","examples":[{"code":"With btn\n  .Text = \"OK\"\nEnd With","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0047"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"プロシージャ","term":"Sub / Function","summary":"値を返さない／返す処理。","examples":[{"code":"Function Add(a As Integer, b As Integer) As Integer\n  Return a + b\nEnd Function","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0048"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"プロシージャ","term":"ByVal / ByRef","summary":"値渡し／参照渡し。","examples":[{"code":"Sub Inc(ByRef n As Integer)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0049"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"プロシージャ","term":"Optional","summary":"省略可能な引数。既定値が必要。","examples":[{"code":"Sub F(Optional n As Integer = 0)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0050"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"プロシージャ","term":"ParamArray","summary":"可変長引数。","examples":[{"code":"Sub F(ParamArray a() As Integer)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0051"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"プロシージャ","term":"オーバーロード","summary":"同名で引数の違う複数の定義。","examples":[{"code":"Overloads Function F(n As Integer)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0052"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"プロシージャ","term":"ラムダ式","summary":"Function や Sub を式の中で書く。","examples":[{"code":"Dim f = Function(x As Integer) x * 2","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0053"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"プロシージャ","term":"拡張メソッド","summary":"既存の型にメソッドを追加。","examples":[{"code":"<Extension()> Function Twice(s As String) As String","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0054"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"プロシージャ","term":"Async / Await","summary":"非同期処理を同期処理のように書きます。UI を固めずに時間のかかる処理ができます。","examples":[{"code":"Async Function LoadAsync() As Task\n  Await Task.Delay(1000)\nEnd Function","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0055"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"クラス","term":"Class","summary":"データと処理をまとめた型。","examples":[{"code":"Class Dog\n  Public Property Name As String\nEnd Class","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0056"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"クラス","term":"Sub New","summary":"コンストラクタ。","examples":[{"code":"Sub New(n As String)\n  Name = n\nEnd Sub","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0057"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"クラス","term":"Property","summary":"プロパティの定義。自動実装なら1行で書ける。","examples":[{"code":"Public Property Age As Integer","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0058"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"クラス","term":"Inherits","summary":"継承。","examples":[{"code":"Class Puppy\n  Inherits Dog\nEnd Class","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0059"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"クラス","term":"MyBase / Me","summary":"親クラス／自分自身。","examples":[{"code":"MyBase.New(n)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0060"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"クラス","term":"Overridable / Overrides","summary":"上書きを許す／上書きする。","examples":[{"code":"Public Overrides Function ToString() As String","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0061"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"クラス","term":"MustInherit / MustOverride","summary":"抽象クラス／抽象メソッド。","examples":[{"code":"MustInherit Class Shape","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0062"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"クラス","term":"Interface / Implements","summary":"約束事を定義し、クラスで実装します。","examples":[{"code":"Interface IFly\n  Sub Fly()\nEnd Interface","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0063"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"クラス","term":"Shared","summary":"インスタンスでなくクラスに属するメンバ（C# の static）。","examples":[{"code":"Shared Count As Integer","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0064"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"クラス","term":"アクセス修飾子","summary":"Public / Private / Protected / Friend。","examples":[{"code":"Private x As Integer","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0065"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"クラス","term":"Event / RaiseEvent","summary":"イベントを定義し発生させます。","examples":[{"code":"Event Changed()\nRaiseEvent Changed()","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0066"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"クラス","term":"Handles / AddHandler","summary":"イベントの処理を結びつける。","examples":[{"code":"Private Sub Btn_Click(...) Handles Btn.Click","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0067"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"クラス","term":"Partial","summary":"1つのクラスを複数ファイルに分ける。Windows フォームのデザイナーが使用。","examples":[{"code":"Partial Class Form1","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0068"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"クラス","term":"Generic（Of T）","summary":"型を引数にした汎用クラス。","examples":[{"code":"Class Box(Of T)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0069"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"クラス","term":"Module","summary":"静的メンバだけをまとめた入れ物。","examples":[{"code":"Module Util","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0070"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"クラス","term":"Namespace","summary":"名前の区画。","examples":[{"code":"Namespace MyApp","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0071"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"文字列","term":"Length / Substring","summary":"文字数／部分文字列。","examples":[{"code":"\"abcdef\".Substring(1, 3)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0072"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"文字列","term":"IndexOf / Contains","summary":"位置／含むか。","examples":[{"code":"s.Contains(\"a\")","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0073"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"文字列","term":"Replace / Trim","summary":"置換／前後の空白除去。","examples":[{"code":"s.Replace(\"a\", \"b\")","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0074"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"文字列","term":"Split / Join","summary":"分割／結合。","examples":[{"code":"\"a,b\".Split(\",\"c)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0075"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"文字列","term":"ToUpper / ToLower","summary":"大文字／小文字。","examples":[{"code":"s.ToUpper()","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0076"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"文字列","term":"String.Format","summary":"書式付き文字列。","examples":[{"code":"String.Format(\"{0:N0}\", 1234567)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0077"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"文字列","term":"StringBuilder","summary":"繰り返しの連結を効率よく。","examples":[{"code":"Dim sb As New StringBuilder()","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0078"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"文字列","term":"Regex","summary":"正規表現。","example